ergy, strength, endurance, pumps and focus."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Xtreme Dosed Formula\r\nFormulated with 16 key ingredients, each selected to serve a specific benefit. This formula is backed by real science. It is purposefully built, not overbuilt without intent.\r\nSuperior Enhancement\r\nEnhanced with 2 innovative ingredients:\r\nMyoTOR for muscle strength acceleration and Rephyll for exercise-related muscle soreness support."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"For more information:\r\n1-888-462-2548\r\nBeyondraw.com"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"FPO"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"An 8-week randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 118 healthy men participating in a supervised resistance training program showed that those taking myoTOR has significant increases in mean upper and lower body strength after 8 weeks vs. those who took a placebo with the same exercise. Improvements in strength were seen in as early as 2 weeks."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"300 mg Caffeine\r\n25 mg Dynamine\r\n5 g Creatine\r\n10 g Citrulline Malate + Citrulline"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Xtreme dosed pre-workout experience"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Gummy Worm Natural & Artificial Flavor"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"6.4 g CarnoSyn\r\n1.5 g Nitrosigine\r\n500 mg Rephyll\r\n325 mg MyoTOR"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Code 364423 AWG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directi